<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's bourse closes on public holiday.</title>
<headline>Morocco's bourse closes on public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casablanca stock exchange was closed on Wednesday on the occasion of King Hassan's 68th birthday called Youth Feast, an official source said.</p>
<p>Public offices and private banks were also closed for 24 hours on the same occasion, the source added.</p>
